"fs.inotify.max_user_watches could not be read"
msgstr ""

#: src/scans/on_access_page/on_access_presentation.rs:390
msgid ""
"clamonacc watches every folder below an included path with inotify, one "
"watch per folder. A whole home directory or larger tree can need more "
"watches than the old default limit of 8192 allows. Raise "
"fs.inotify.max_user_watches with sysctl."
msgstr ""

